# Build context allowlist for service/Dockerfile (BuildKit uses this file instead of the root .dockerignore).
# The taxonomy cache is not in this context: it comes in through the named build context "taxonomy".
*
!arelle/
!arelleCmdLine.py
!requirements.txt
!service/

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
arelle/plugin/EDGAR
arelle/plugin/xule
service/Dockerfile*
service/build_image.sh
# Build-time only (warm-up TLS); not needed in the offline image.
service/certs
